This Design is a simple 8 bit counter design. 

It contains the below,
a. RTL : counter.v
b. TB : counter_test.v
c. Netlist : counter_netlist.v
d. Library : slow_vdd1v0_basicCells.v
e. SDF : delays.sdf
f. Few run files to help you run the flow.

Please go through the runme and run.f files to understand the switches used to run the Gate Level Simulation of this design.
